{"suttaId":"tha-ap132","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5987,6019],"vripara":"97"},"segments":{"tha-ap132:0.3":"Padumapūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap132:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, gotamo nāma pabbato;","tha-ap132:1.3":"Nānārukkhehi sañchanno, mahābhūtagaṇālayo.","tha-ap132:2.1":"“Vemajjhamhi ca tassāsi, assamo abhinimmito;","tha-ap132:2.3":"Purakkhato sasissehi, vasāmi assame ahaṃ.","tha-ap132:3.1":"“Āyantu me sissagaṇā, padumaṃ āharantu me;","tha-ap132:3.3":"Buddhapūjaṃ karissāmi, dvipadindassa tādino.","tha-ap132:4.1":"“Evanti te paṭissutvā, padumaṃ āhariṃsu me;","tha-ap132:4.3":"Tathā nimittaṃ katvāhaṃ, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap132:5.1":"“Sisse tadā samānetvā, sādhukaṃ anusāsahaṃ;","tha-ap132:5.3":"Mā kho tumhe pamajjittha, appamādo sukhāvaho.","tha-ap132:6.1":"“Evaṃ samanusāsitvā, te sisse vacanakkhame;","tha-ap132:6.3":"Appamādaguṇe yutto, tadā kālaṅkato ahaṃ.","tha-ap132:7.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap132:7.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap132:8.1":"“Ekapaññāsakappamhi, rājā āsiṃ jaluttamo;","tha-ap132:8.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap132:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap132:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā padumapūjako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap132:11.1":"Padumapūjakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap132:12.1":"Sereyyavaggo terasamo.","tha-ap132:13.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap132:14.1":"Sereyyako pupphathūpi, pāyaso gandhathomako;","tha-ap132:14.3":"Āsani phalasaññī ca, gaṇṭhipadumapupphiyo;","tha-ap132:14.5":"Pañcuttarasatā gāthā, gaṇitā atthadassibhi."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2933,"to":2934,"paras":[{"para":2933,"vripara":"97","refs":["tha-ap132:1"],"lines":["So attano puññakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>himavantassāvidūre</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Gotamo nāma pabbato</b>ti anekesaṃ yakkhadevatānaṃ āvāsabhāvena adhiṭṭhānavasena gotamassa bhavanattā gotamoti pākaṭo ahosi.","Pavattati tiṭṭhatīti pabbato.","<b>Nāgarukkhehi sañchanno</b>ti ruhati tiṭṭhatīti rukkho.","Atha vā pathaviṃ khananto uddhaṃ ruhatīti rukkho, nānā anekappakārā campakakappūranāgaagarucandanādayo rukkhāti nānārukkhā, tehi nānārukkhehi sañchanno parikiṇṇo gotamo pabbatoti sambandho.","<b>Mahābhūtagaṇālayo</b>ti bhavanti jāyanti uppajjanti vaḍḍhanti cāti bhūtā, mahantā ca te bhūtā cāti mahābhūtā, mahābhūtānaṃ gaṇo samūhoti mahābhūtagaṇo, mahābhūtagaṇassa ālayo patiṭṭhāti mahābhūtagaṇālayo."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap132:1"],["tha-ap132:1"],["tha-ap132:1"],["tha-ap132:1"],["tha-ap132:1"],["tha-ap132:1"]]},{"para":2934,"vripara":"98","refs":["tha-ap132:2"],"lines":["<b>Vemajjhamhi ca tassāsī</b>ti tassa gotamassa pabbatassa vemajjhe abbhantare assamo abhinimmito nipphādito katoti attho.","Sesaṃ uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap132:2"],["tha-ap132:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap132:1.1","himavantassāvidūre",0,0],["tha-ap132:1.1","gotamo nāma pabbato",0,1],["tha-ap132:1.3","mahābhūtagaṇālayo",0,5],["tha-ap132:2.1","vemajjhamhi ca tassāsī",1,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
